  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate Children &amp; Empower Youths in a Lagos Slum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a community based organization, we provide an opportunity for children and youths in an underserved slum community to have a shot at life. We support children to go to school, stay in school and gain quality education. We   empower youths with employability or vocational &amp; entrepreneurial skills, to become economically engaged and make a living for themselves. We do this because every child deserves quality education, safety and a chance to thrive, irrespective of their backgrounds.</narrative>
  </description>
